msgid "AP_Periph"
msgstr "AP_Periph"

#: ../../source/docs/ap-peripheral-landing-page.rst:12
#: 4ab69bc4bd214c989c682f7b03dd484c
msgid ""
"AP_Periph is an abbreviation for ArduPilot Peripheral, ie. an ArduPilot "
"peripheral device based on the existing ArduPilot autopilot code. It takes "
"peripheral device driver libraries of ArduPilot and adapts them to run on "
"stand-alone peripheral devices, which communicate to the main autopilot via "
"CAN, MSP, or other peripheral bus protocols."
msgstr ""
"AP_Periph 是 ArduPilot Peripheral 的缩写，即基于现有 ArduPilot 飞控代码的 ArduPilot "
"外设设备。它获取 ArduPilot 的外设驱动程序库并将其适配，使其能在独立外设设备上运行，这些设备通过 CAN、MSP "
"或其他外设总线协议与主飞控通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/ap-peripheral-landing-page.rst:14
#: 85d1034ed7e04fdca8899f44bc7ddb58
msgid ""
"The Peripheral device supports a wide range of STM32 processors, including "
"F103, F303, F4xx, F7xx, G4xx and H7. Both sensors (distance sensor, GNSS, "
"IMU, Barometer, battery, etc.) and output ports (I2C, SPI, PWM, UART, ESC, "
"LED, etc.) can be used to build new peripherals, as well as providing bus "
"expansion for CAN, MSP, I2C, SPI, etc."
msgstr ""
"外设设备支持广泛的 STM32 处理器，包括 F103、F303、F4xx、F7xx、G4xx 和 "
"H7。传感器（距离传感器、GNSS、IMU、气压计、电池等）和输出端口（I2C、SPI、PWM、UART、电调、LED 等）均可用于构建新外设，同时为 "
"CAN、MSP、I2C、SPI 等提供总线扩展。"

#: ../../source/docs/ap-peripheral-landing-page.rst:20
#: 2db86414ef254282b3fdd481404c979d
msgid ""
"The software uses the same build system as ArduPilot for autopilot boards. "
"All the firmware build configuration for an AP_Periph board done using a "
"single configuration file (hwdef.dat) defines the inputs/outputs of the "
"device and what device drivers will be included, in the same manner as an "
"autopilot board. This makes it possible, for example, to define an AP_Periph"
" device for UAVCAN with only a micro-controller of the STM32F103 type and "
"128 KB of flash memory, although processors with larger memory will be "
"required depending on the number of drivers."
msgstr ""
"该软件使用与 ArduPilot 飞控飞控板相同的构建系统。AP_Periph "
"飞控板的所有固件构建配置通过单个配置文件（hwdef.dat）完成，该文件以与飞控飞控板相同的方式定义设备的输入/输出以及将包含哪些设备驱动程序。例如，这使得仅使用"
" STM32F103 型微控制器和 128 KB 闪存即可定义用于 UAVCAN 的 AP_Periph "
"设备成为可能，但根据驱动程序数量，可能需要具有更大内存的处理器。"

